  "about": "As tiny-chao-garden, from power-on with nothing saved to Tiny Chao Garden; then A three times rocks the egg, which hatches, and the hand goes up to the right icon for the card game, finding all seven pairs with no mistakes for 90 rings. Back in the garden, L opens the shop, sliding in from the left with its prices, and A on the first fruit buys it for 30 rings, the shop sliding away. The hand carries the fruit and puts it down on the grass, where the Chao looks at it, picks it up again and gives it to the Chao, which eats it, its skills going up. L opens the shop again, and A on the egg, which costs nothing, takes it; the hand puts it down, picks it up again with the Chao about, and puts it down once more. Last, L opens the shop and L closes it.",
